hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16711","Abu Abd al-Rahman Abd Allah ibn Yazid narrated to us, he said: Ikrima narrated to us, he said: Abu Zumayl Simak narrated to us, he said: a man from Banu Hilal narrated to me, he said: I heard the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) say: Charity is not lawful for a rich man nor for one possessing sound strength."
